  "prefLabel": "Plc 1100 REFLEXOLOGISTS, STRUCTURAL INTEGRATORS, AND ASIAN BODYWORK THERAPISTS",
  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Plc 1100 REFLEXOLOGISTS, STRUCTURAL INTEGRATORS, AND ASIAN BODYWORK THERAPISTS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 310:6, II; RSA 328-H:5, VIII\n\nREVISION NOTE:\n\nPursuant to 2015, 276:107, effective 7-1-15, rulemaking authority under RSA 328-H:5, II, V, and VIII and RSA 328-H:15 over reflexologists, structural integrators, and Asian bodywork therapists was transferred to the Executive Director of the Office of Professional Licensure and Certification from the Commissioner of the Department of Health and Human Services. The existing rules of the Department numbered Chapter He-P 1400 and titled “Reflexologists, Structural Integrators, and Asian Bodywork Therapists” were also transferred pursuant to 2015, 276:45 under RSA 310-A:1-a, III. The former Chapter He-P 1400 subsequently expired 3-20-18. RSA 310-A:1-a, III was later amended as RSA 310-A:1-a, II pursuant to 2021, 91:76.\n\nDocument #13391, effective 5-27-22, adopted a new Chapter Plc 1100 titled “Reflexologists, Structural Integrators, and Asian Bodywork Therapists.” Document #13391 replaced the prior filing for He-P 1400 in Document #9681, effective 3-20-10, which had expired 3-20-18.",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc1100.html"
}
